       fhir:ImplementationGuide.definition.resource.description [ fhir:value "DAK component 3. A narrative describing how personas interact. Carries `personas 0..* id`, which is the only structured link between the narrative layer and the personas it names. resolutionStatus is `unresolved` on a component that something else names but no DAK declares -- an L3 artefact whose title carries the component id, for instance. The node exists so the gap is queryable and carries the referenced id and nothing else. Class IRI: http://smart.who.int/kg/user-scenario." ] ;
       fhir:ImplementationGuide.definition.resource.exampleBoolean [ fhir:value "false"^^xsd:boolean ]
